            <title>[IGNITE-14582] Continuous Query deploys remote filter even on client nodes</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14582</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When the client node joins cluster CQ routine is deployed on it, but there&apos;s no sense to have CQ on the client node which doesn&apos;t store any data at all.&lt;/p&gt;

